 "remarks": "Picturesque 3 bed, 2.5 bath colonial, in prime location. Enjoy Wilton schools in a home that provides the best of both worlds: nature and convenience. The ample outdoor space provides 1.23 flat, usable acres and fenced in garden- while being steps away from the Branchville station, and nearby restaurants.  Setup for entertaining, this home offers a front porch, large back deck, refreshed kitchen (with newer appliances), and plenty of outdoor access.  The primary bedroom has ample space with an en-suite, large walk in closet, and a secondary closet. The basement offers open space and high ceilings- perfect for additional storage, a home gym or something to finish down the road.",
